<title>POLAND: NFI Progress nets PLN 55.4 mln H1.</title>
<headline>NFI Progress nets PLN 55.4 mln H1.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish National Investment Fund (NFI) Progress (No. 4) preliminary results for the first half of 1997, in millions of zlotys:</p>
<p>					H1 1997		   H1 1996</p>
<p>  Net profit			 55.42		     13.77 loss</p>
<p>  Investment portfolio	  414.72		    385.60</p>
<p>  Liabilities and reserves     15.75		     10.84</p>
<p>  Net assets			413.32		    375.36</p>
<p>  Assets per share (PLN)	 13.32		     10.72</p>
<p>NOTE: The full company name is Narodowy Fundusz Inwestycyjny Progress SA. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
